2. Targeted enterprises (individual, cooperatives) both in host community and in refugee population enabled to expand, add value to their products and move up the value chain across the country with a focus
3. Support the review of Regional Socio-Economic Profile
4. Identify Innovative sustainable solutions with potential in tackling socio-economic development challenges within their areas</narrative>
      </comment>
